    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EXOMECHA\u2122 is a brand-new multiplayer shooter that takes place in OMECHA, an untouched planet with exotic environments. It offers you a breathtaking\u00a0sci-fi gaming experience with its infantry, vehicular and mecha combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play your favorite game mode:<br>- Conquest, vehicular team-based battle\u00a0(20v20)<br>- Mecha Royale, start as infantry and call your EXOMECHA towards end of the match (1v100)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape from the Mecha Dragon:     <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/424e5b8f9205929fad6d53e4d7a0278a.poster.avif?t=1753771138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/424e5b8f9205929fad6d53e4d7a0278a.webm?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/424e5b8f9205929fad6d53e4d7a0278a.mp4?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Skydive onto a secret island and survive till your EXOMECHA is ready:        <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/87b48acccdaadcd0ff525f15da25a828.poster.avif?t=1753771138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/87b48acccdaadcd0ff525f15da25a828.webm?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/87b48acccdaadcd0ff525f15da25a828.mp4?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Call your EXOMECHA:   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/c80b1fe55b2076c5e196c8f9f046bf32.poster.avif?t=1753771138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/c80b1fe55b2076c5e196c8f9f046bf32.webm?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/c80b1fe55b2076c5e196c8f9f046bf32.mp4?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Fight other EXOMECHAs: <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/9a3518fa8fe91067e9665e9312169db0.poster.avif?t=1753771138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/9a3518fa8fe91067e9665e9312169db0.webm?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/9a3518fa8fe91067e9665e9312169db0.mp4?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Fly to The Dragon Island and take your revenge:         <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/a4cfa380b599b07df632af504c00f689.poster.avif?t=1753771138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/a4cfa380b599b07df632af504c00f689.webm?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397440/extras/a4cfa380b599b07df632af504c00f689.mp4?t=1753771138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
